NAME%,</p>\n                       <p style=\"margin: 20px 0 0 0; font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 17px !important; line-height: 28px; color: #16243d\">Teno here 🐦 I took the answers you gave me during setup and ran them against your plan. Here is exactly where you stand.</p>","id":"92b9bdc7-a231-477e-9ec9-e2ef12a91640","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":0,"left":40,"right":40,"top":0},"mobile":{"bottom":0,"left":22,"right":22,"top":0}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"font-size: 17px !important; line-height: 28px; color: #16243d; margin: 0; font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Your <a href=\"https://fiteno.app/checkout/?email=%EMAIL%&uuid=%EXTERNAL_CUSTOMER_ID%\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #FF5A3C\"><strong>4-week plan</strong></a> is built and waiting in your account.</p>","id":"fc77b777-332d-4ad4-9ab0-f716423366d8","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":0,"left":40,"right":40,"top":20},"mobile":{"bottom":0,"left":22,"right":22,"top":20}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 19px !important; line-height: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #ff5a3c; margin: 0\">Your welcome discount is still reserved — and it is time-limited.</p>","id":"ac44ab44-57c5-4e74-a8a0-d50662d8fdf5","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#ff5a3c","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":0,"left":40,"right":40,"top":8},"mobile":{"bottom":0,"left":22,"right":22,"top":8}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 17px !important; line-height: 28px; color: #16243d; margin: 0\"><strong>Your setup:</strong><br>\n                         ➡️ time you have: 15 minutes a day<br>\n                         ➡️ starting point: back after a long break<br>\n                         ➡️ equipment: none</p>","id":"e9f53823-1595-4976-a430-6b4ccb96e31f","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":0,"left":40,"right":40,"top":26},"mobile":{"bottom":0,"left":22,"right":22,"top":26}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"color: #16243d; margin: 0; font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 17px !important; line-height: 28px\"><strong>Your plan check:</strong><br>\n                         ✅ Session length — 7-minute sessions fit inside your 15<br>\n                         ✅ Equipment — 400+ guided workouts, none needed<br>\n                         ✅ Missed days — your week reshuffles instead of resetting<br>\n                         ✅ Offline — download the week, train anywhere<br>\n                         ⚡ Consistency — 2 days a week is the one to move<br>\n                         ⚡ Nudges — switched off, so I cannot remind you yet</p>","id":"4f47a6f5-3d43-4252-bc6a-bb443c1043cc","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":0,"left":40,"right":40,"top":24},"mobile":{"bottom":0,"left":22,"right":22,"top":24}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"color: #16243d; margin: 0; font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 17px !important; line-height: 28px\"><strong>Ready to start: 4 of 6</strong> — and both amber lines are settings, not effort.</p>","id":"8204e95a-70b0-4b8e-b394-8bf788fd7d31","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d